{
  "_help": [
    "Every event that makes Misty speak or play a sound. Each reaction = one Foxglove button",
    "(re-run scripts/make_foxglove_layout.py and re-import the layout after adding/removing reactions;",
    "edits to sentences/voices apply immediately, no restart).",
    "Reaction fields: id (unique, used by buttons), label, group (Foxglove tab), color,",
    "  voice (preset name from 'voices' or an object {pitch, rate, voice, language}),",
    "  sentences: list of strings or {text, voice | pitch | rate} objects; a press says one at random",
    "  button: false -> no Foxglove button (still usable in steps and via REACT:<id>),",
    "  each: true -> one button per sentence instead of one random button,",
    "  sounds: list of Misty audio files (a press plays one at random), volume (0-100),",
    "  steps: a sequence: {say: <reaction id>} | {text: '...', voice: ...} | {sound: 'file.wav'} |",
    "         {sound_from: <reaction id>} | {pause: seconds}; sounds take an optional wait (seconds).",
    "Custom text from Foxglove can pick a voice with a prefix: [sad] I am so tired."
  ],
  "voices": {
    "_help": "pitch / rate: 1.0 = normal (try roughly 0.5 - 2.0); voice: '' = Misty default; language: '' = default",
    "neutral": {
      "pitch": 1.0,
      "rate": 1.0,
      "voice": "",
      "language": ""
    },
    "happy": {
      "pitch": 1.25,
      "rate": 1.1,
      "voice": "",
      "language": ""
    },
    "sad": {
      "pitch": 0.8,
      "rate": 0.8,
      "voice": "",
      "language": ""
    },
    "angry": {
      "pitch": 0.9,
      "rate": 1.2,
      "voice": "",
      "language": ""
    },
    "confused": {
      "pitch": 1.1,
      "rate": 0.9,
      "voice": "",
      "language": ""
    }
  },
